 "lines": [
  {"text": "Aapki poori dukaan kisi aur ke platform pe hai? Festive season se pehle wahi platform rules badal sakta hai.", "wav": "/tmp/claude-0/w/l1.wav"},
  {"text": "Pehli baat. Amazon ne 17 August se seller cancellation fee ka tareeka badla. Ab ye order value ke hisaab se lagta hai. Rules platform ke, marzi platform ki.", "wav": "/tmp/claude-0/w/l2.wav"},
  {"text": "Doosri baat. Marketplace pe customer milte hain, par wo platform ka hota hai, aapka nahi. Unka sampark aur order history apne paas rakho.", "wav": "/tmp/claude-0/w/l3.wav"},
  {"text": "Teesri baat. Website ya WhatsApp catalogue jaisa apna channel banao, jahan repeat customer seedha order kare. Ek baar system bane, toh ye video save kar lo.", "wav": "/tmp/claude-0/w/l4.wav"}
